        <div>
          <head n="2" source="#source-160849-160936"><seg source="#source-160849-160858">天寿国</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-160858-160888"><rb>曼荼羅</rb><rt>まんだら</rt></ruby></head>
