      <div type="layout" source="#source-360390-361677" style="padding-inline-start: 3em">
        <p><seg source="#source-360425-360460">ひまなくぞ雨はふりけり</seg></p>
        <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-360460-360484"><rb>足曳</rb><rt>あしびき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-360484-360523">の三笠の山のふもとなるこの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-360523-360541"><rb>夕</rb><rt>ゆふべ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-360541-360549">はも</seg></p>
        <p><seg source="#source-360549-360555">松が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-360555-360567"><rb>枝</rb><rt>え</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-360567-360593">のしづくにぬれて</seg></p>
        <p><seg source="#source-360593-360605">秋草に　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-360605-360620"><rb>黙</rb><rt>もだ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-360620-360629">し伏す</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-360629-360644"><rb>巨</rb><rt>おほ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-360644-360661">きいしずゑ</seg></p>
        <p><seg source="#source-360661-360673">遠つ代の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-360673-360691"><rb>聖</rb><rt>ひじり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-360691-360694">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-360694-360712"><rb>帝</rb><rt>みかど</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-360712-360715">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-360715-360730"><rb>御</rb><rt>おん</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-360730-360745"><rb>夢</rb><rt>ゆめ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-360745-360763">を　うつつに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-360763-360778"><rb>偲</rb><rt>しの</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-360778-360798">ぶしるしかな</seg></p>
        <p><seg source="#source-360798-360824">いのちあらば語れ</seg></p>
        <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-360824-360836"><rb>汝</rb><rt>な</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-360836-360875">が背にそびえしくれなゐの　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-360875-360890"><rb>円</rb><rt>まろ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-360890-360910">き柱はいかに</seg></p>
        <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-360910-360928"><rb>願</rb><rt>ねがひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-360928-360946">ひそめてそが</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-360946-360961"><rb>蔭</rb><rt>かげ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-360961-360973">に寄りし</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-360973-360988"><rb>貴</rb><rt>あて</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-360988-360991">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-360991-361012"><rb>女人</rb><rt>おみな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-361012-361017">の</seg></p>
        <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-361017-361038"><rb>玉裳</rb><rt>たまも</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-361038-361041">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-361041-361056"><rb>紐</rb><rt>ひも</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-361056-361076">のゆらぐまに</seg></p>
        <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-361076-361088"><rb>汝</rb><rt>な</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-361088-361123">が背にひびきつたはりし</seg></p>
        <p><seg source="#source-361123-361158">かそけき祈りのつぶやき</seg></p>
        <p><seg source="#source-361158-361179">はた尊きみ足の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-361179-361206"><rb>跫音</rb><rt>きょうおん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-361206-361211">！</seg></p>
        <p><seg source="#source-361211-361217">げに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-361217-361235"><rb>寧楽</rb><rt>なら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-361235-361244">びとが</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-361244-361262"><rb>念</rb><rt>おもひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-361262-361277">に耐へて　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-361277-361292"><rb>汝</rb><rt>なれ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-361292-361295">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-361295-361316"><rb>千年</rb><rt>ちとせ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-361316-361319">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-361319-361331"><rb>経</rb><rt>へ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-361331-361347">ぬるかな</seg></p>
        <p><seg source="#source-361347-361370">われなづさへて</seg></p>
        <p><seg source="#source-361370-361376">柔き</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-361376-361391"><rb>苔</rb><rt>こけ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-361391-361394">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-361394-361415"><rb>微光</rb><rt>ひかり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-361415-361436">に　かすかなる</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-361436-361457"><rb>息吹</rb><rt>いぶき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-361457-361460">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-361460-361478"><rb>窺</rb><rt>うかが</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-361478-361486">ひぬ</seg></p>
        <p><seg source="#source-361486-361515">いのちなきものかは</seg></p>
        <p><seg source="#source-361515-361544">いのちなきものかは</seg></p>
        <p><seg source="#source-361544-361591">ひまなくぞ雨はふりけり秋のくれ</seg></p>
        <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-361591-361603"><rb>啼</rb><rt>な</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-361603-361641">く鹿の声のしみわたるかな</seg></p>
